    <introduction>
      <p>
        The aim of this website is to be a place for all my work.
        It is possible that I occasionally forget adding something that I've done
        here.
      </p>

      <p>
        Thank you to <pretext/> for the incredible software and Kiran Kedlaya
        for introducing me to it.
      </p>

      <p>
        An older version of my attempt at a portfolio website is <url href="./3D/index.html">here</url>. These were the times when I was working a lot with <c>A-Frame</c> and more 3D website stuff. (As a result, it is severely underdeveloped, but cool nonetheless because it was not AI-slopped together.)
      </p>
    </introduction>

    <section xml:id="about-me">
      <title>About Me</title>

<p>
      My name is Taraash Mittal. I am currently a final-year undergraduate at the Indraprastha Institute of Information Technology (IIIT Delhi) and I got my schooling from Pragyan, Greater Noida.
